{"tool_name":"sage-proteomics","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"Sage-proteomics","home":"https://github.com/lazear/sage","license":"MIT","summary":"Sage is a proteomics database search engine to match tandem mass spectra to peptides. Sage also performs retention time prediction, quantificaiton and FDR control.","addition_date":"2024-02-13T15:27:57.571212Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T13:47:03.844336Z","biotools_curie":"biotools:Sage-proteomics","documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"https://sage-docs.vercel.app/docs"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"Mass spectrum","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0943"},"format":[{"term":"mzML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3244"}]},{"data":{"term":"Protein sequence","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_2976"},"format":[{"term":"FASTA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_1929"}]}],"operation":[{"term":"Peptide identification","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3631"},{"term":"Retention time prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3633"},{"term":"Validation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2428"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Peptide identification","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_0945"},"format":[{"term":"TSV","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3475"}]}]}],"name":"Sage","owner":"n.m.palmblad@lumc.nl","publication":[{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jproteome.3c00486","metadata":{"abstract":"The growing complexity and volume of proteomics data necessitate the development of efficient software tools for peptide identification and quantification from mass spectra. Given their central role in proteomics, it is imperative that these tools are auditable and extensible\u2500requirements that are best fulfilled by open-source and permissively licensed software. This work presents Sage, a high-performance, open-source, and freely available proteomics pipeline. Scalable and cloud-ready, Sage matches the performan